                "text": "Thanks to the Affordable Care Act, tens of millions of Americans can afford high-quality health care. \n\nBut under the Republican budget plan, the 32,000 people who receive ACA coverage in San Francisco would see their average premium go up by $3,070 per year \u2014 a 112% increase.",
