                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Now, Republicans have gut them with the Big, Ugly Law\u2014ripping away coverage, raising costs and leaving working families behind.\n\nWe can\u2019t let it stand. Instead of agonizing, we're organizing to #CancelTheCuts and preserve these vital initiatives\u2014for the next 60 years and beyond. https://t.co/mKjp8NzHEZ",
