                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Senate\u2019s CR fails to meet the needs of America\u2019s working families. \n\nI join the House Democratic Leadership and my colleagues who oppose this legislation which allows the ACA tax credits to expire \u2013 driving up premiums and costs for tens of millions of Americans already struggling to make ends meet. \n\nWe must continue to fight for a responsible, bipartisan path forward that reopens the government and keeps health care affordable for the American people.",
